---
import * as icons from "@grave/animated-icons/astro";
import { handsGestures } from "../../../../helpers/hands-gestures";
const sizes = [14, 16, 24, 28];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Hand and gesture recipe comparisons</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>Hand and gesture recipe comparisons</h1>
    <p>The reference executes all ten original Lucide Animated React components from revision 4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26. Their class utility import points to a local equivalent. React is confined to comparison pages.</p>
    <p>Hover a row or use its Replay button to animate both versions. Play all starts every sample. Stop all returns them to rest. Seek pauses the current playback at the selected time.</p>
    <p>Whole-SVG gestures keep their original timing and pivots. Coins have separate spring translations and opacity. The heart uses separate translation and scale tracks. BicepsFlexed loops three independent path transforms. Clap keeps its nested group pivots.</p>
    <p>The copied Clap component adds initial="normal" to both groups so its declared 4px 20px and 3px 11px origins apply on the first entry as well as later entries. The adapter uses the same fill-box origins. Other copied components change only their class utility import.</p>
    <p>Finite reference return seeks clamp to each track's actual duration. Return measurements start at 25 ms because Motion may snap tiny scale displacements to rest at time zero, while the adapter preserves the first pose for stop continuity. Return comparisons capture poses and reset reference velocity before stopping. Interrupted spring velocity parity remains unmeasured. Visual acceptance remains with manual review.</p>
    <button type="button" id="play">Play all</button>
    <button type="button" id="stop">Stop all</button>
    <label>Playback time in milliseconds <input id="time" type="number" value="200" min="0" max="5000" step="50" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="seek">Seek and pause</button>
    {handsGestures.map(icon => {
      const Component = icons[icon.name];
      return <section>
        <h2>{icon.name}</h2>
        <p><a href={`https://github.com/pqoqubbw/icons/blob/4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26/icons/${icon.slug}.tsx`}>Pinned upstream recipe</a> · <a href={`/${icon.slug}/`}>Manual controls and lifecycle</a></p>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Astro adapter</th><th>Upstream React component</th><th>Playback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{sizes.map(size => <tr data-icon={icon.slug} data-size={size}>
            <th scope="row">{size} px</th>
            <td data-adapter><Component size={size} controlled /></td>
            <td><div data-reference data-name={icon.name} data-size={size}></div></td>
            <td><button type="button" data-replay aria-label={`Replay ${icon.name} at ${size} pixels`}>Replay</button></td>
          </tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </section>;
    })}
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import "../hands-gestures-reference";
</script>
